--- Float Arithmetic & Mixed Operations ---
10.5 + 2: 12.5
10.5 - 2.5: 8
2.5 * -4.0: -10
7.5 / 2.5: 3
10.5 % 3.0: 1.5
--- Float Relational & Equality Comparisons ---
3.14 > 3.0: true
2.5 <= 2.5: true
2.5 == 2.5: true
-0.5 < 0.0: true
--- Float Conversions ---
int(3.99): 3
int(-3.99): -3
tonumber('3.14159'): 3.14159
tonumber('-0.5'): -0.5
--- Division by zero float ---
1.0 / 0.0: nil